  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Regional Initiative for Strengthening SAI Effectiveness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program aims to strengthen Supreme Audit Institutions in their core mandates, including their independence, legal frameworks, audit practices, and related areas. The programme includes engagement inSouth Sudan, the Democratic Republic of Congo, Niger, Malawi, Madagascar and Guinea.
The individual country projects will involve capacity development through support from peers iin other countries&#x2019; supreme audit institutions (including from the region or continent), and will consist of on-the-job support, mentoring related to specific audits, training in global tools and resources, and, where relevant, investigations in IT and digitalization. The support will be coordinated with regional organizations such as AFROSAI-E/CREFIAF and other partners.</narrative>
  </description>
